  triage:title "parse_bootstrap_agent/parse_bootstrap_team missing .with_recovery()" ;
  triage:description "parse_bootstrap_agent and parse_bootstrap_team at crates/atm-daemon-client/src/lib.rs:419 are missing .with_recovery() calls. Both functions use .unwrap_or_else so they never return Err in practice. This finding auto-resolves if ARCH-002 is fixed and the env-var parse moves to the composition layer." ;
